            <p>
                <!--<$[信息内容]>begin--><!--ZJEG_RSS.content.begin--><meta name="ContentStart"><p>&nbsp;</p><div style="display: none; opacity: 0;"></div><p style="text-indent: 43px;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">为方便考生领取人事考试报名考试费票据，自</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">2022</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">年起，我市人事考试中心组织的考录公务员、事业单位招聘、专技类考试不再发放纸质发票，统一提供电子票据，由考生自助下载打印。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;"><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK;"><span style="font-size: 24px;">一、省考公务员笔试费</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px; -ms-word-break: break-all;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">电子票据由盐城市人力资源和社会保障局开具。</span><strong><span style="font-family: 方正楷体_GBK;">操作办法</span></strong><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">：考生成功网报缴费后可登录“非税收入电子票据平台”（</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">https://jsfs.yeepay.com/js-pre-nontax-app/invoice?merchantNo=10033291207</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">），在网站指定位置输入“姓名”、“身份证号”、“验证码”信息，点击查询、下载电子票据。电子票据申领截止时间为下一年度该项考试报名前。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;"><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK;"><span style="font-size: 24px;">二、咨询工程师（投资）考试费</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">电子票据由中国工程咨询协会统一开具。</span><strong><span style="font-family: 方正楷体_GBK;">操作办法：</span></strong><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">考生成功网报缴费后，请按系统提示网上填写相关开票信息，详情见当年度考试报名公告。电子票据申领截止时间为考试年度</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">12</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">月底前。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;"><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK;"><span style="font-size: 24px;">三、省考公务员面试、事业单位招聘和其他专技类考试费</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">电子票据由盐城市人力资源和社会保障局开具。</span><strong><span style="font-family: 方正楷体_GBK;">操作办法</span></strong><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">：考生成功网报缴费后，可于准考证打印之日起一年内，登录“苏服办”</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">APP</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">自助下载打印。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;"><strong><span style="font-family: 方正楷体_GBK;"><span style="font-size: 24px;">“苏服办”APP</span><span style="font-size: 24px;">操作说明</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">1</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">．考生用手机下载“苏服办”</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">APP</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">，图标为</span><a href="/picture/0/784eb7634839445589968872934b2a03.jpg" target="_blank"><img width="87" height="72" title="6.jpg" style="border: currentColor; border-image: none; width: 29px; height: 27px;" src="/picture/0/784eb7634839445589968872934b2a03.jpg"/></a><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">2</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">．未注册“苏服办”</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">APP</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">账号考生，请按照</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">APP</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">提示要求注册账号，已注册账号考生可在</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">APP</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">“我的”页面点击“立即登录”。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 24px;"><a href="/picture/0/5bacdfe39b6641ccbd00421e0f8f6854.png" target="_blank"><img title="1.png" style="border: currentColor; border-image: none;" src="/picture/0/5bacdfe39b6641ccbd00421e0f8f6854.png"/></a></span></p><p><span style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 24px;"><br/></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 24px;"><a href="/picture/0/6a34bb79fd494415be3af4425c519ca0.png" target="_blank"><img title="2.png" style="border: currentColor; border-image: none;" src="/picture/0/6a34bb79fd494415be3af4425c519ca0.png"/></a>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p><p style="text-indent: 43px;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">3</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">．考生登录</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">APP</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">后，请在“我的”页面上点击“电子票据”进入“江苏省财政电子票夹”页面，点击该页面“我的票据”图标，在所显示页面中点击“电子票总数”图标，通过选择相应的年份、月份可查询到所需电子票据，显示相关票据的页面下方有“发送邮件”“下载”两个按钮，考生可自行选择操作。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 24px;"><a href="/picture/0/1565b8d139244103852cd340196e201a.png" target="_blank"><img title="3.png" style="border: currentColor; border-image: none;" src="/picture/0/1565b8d139244103852cd340196e201a.png"/></a>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 24px;"><br/></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 24px;"><a href="/picture/0/79ef60e34bd64b41834a6a7569a9b895.png" target="_blank"><img title="4.png" style="border: currentColor; border-image: none;" src="/picture/0/79ef60e34bd64b41834a6a7569a9b895.png"/></a><span style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 24px;"></span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 24px;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 24px;"><br/></span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 24px;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 24px;"><a href="/picture/0/9791bcd6b785461ca682cdc79e28ebd2.png" target="_blank"><img title="5.png" style="border: currentColor; border-image: none;" src="/picture/0/9791bcd6b785461ca682cdc79e28ebd2.png"/></a></span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 24px;">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 24px;">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: right;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">2022</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">年</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">5</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">月</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">5</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK;">日</span></span></p><div style="display: none; opacity: 0;"></div><div style="display: none; opacity: 0;"></div><div style="display: none; opacity: 0;"></div><div style="display: none; opacity: 0;"></div><div style="display: none; opacity: 0;"></div><meta name="ContentEnd"><!--ZJEG_RSS.content.end--><!--<$[信息内容]>end-->
            </p>
